/*
 * TestRiscvSemanticsVector.cpp
 *
 * Tests of the RISC-V lifter of the vector instructions (RiscvSemantics.h,
 * RiscvSemanticVector.h): the rows of tests/riscv/RiscvSemanticVectorRows64.inc
 * and RiscvSemanticVectorRows32.inc (an instruction, a start state with the
 * vector configuration and the state QEMU and Spike end in, generated by
 * tests/riscv/semantics/gen_unit_rows_vector.py) run by the interpreter at
 * VLEN 128, 256 and 512, the coverage of the vector encoding tables by the
 * vector semantic table and the classification.
 *
 * The differential tests against QEMU and Spike (tests/riscv/semantics, the
 * rv_vgen_* corpus) cover the whole instruction list; these rows pin a sample
 * of it without the processors.
 *
 * Author: Elad Raz <e@eladraz.com>
 */
